## Starbucks Announces Increase in Quarterly Cash Dividend


10/07/2026


Download (opens in new window)


Recognizing its Sixteenth Consecutive Annual Increase


SEATTLE--(BUSINESS WIRE)--


Starbucks Corporation (NASDAQ: SBUX) today announced that its Board of Directors has approved an increase in the company’s quarterly cash dividend from $0.62 to $0.63 per share of outstanding Common Stock. The increased dividend will be payable in cash on November 27, 2026, to shareholders of record on November 13, 2026. This change reflects an annualized dividend rate of $2.52 per share.


“Today’s dividend increase reflects our continued confidence and belief that disciplined execution of our Back to Starbucks strategy will drive sustainable long-term growth and value creation,” said Cathy Smith, chief financial officer.


Starbucks Coffee Company first initiated its dividend program in 2010 with a quarterly payout of $0.05 per share and has since grown its dividend at a compound annual growth rate of approximately 17%. This growth underscores the company’s long-standing commitment to returning value to shareholders.


**About Starbucks**


Since 1971, Starbucks Coffee Company has been committed to responsibly sourcing and roasting high-quality *arabica* coffee. Today, with a global footprint of more than 41,000 company-operated and licensed coffeehouses and a growing presence in consumer-packaged goods, we are the world's premier purveyor of specialty coffee. Through our unwavering commitment to excellence and our guiding principles, we bring the unique *Starbucks Experience* to life for every customer through every cup. To share in the experience, please visit us in our coffeehouses or online at[about.starbucks.com](https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&url=http%3A%2F%2Fabout.starbucks.com&esheet=54616558&newsitemid=20261007776907&lan=en-US&anchor=about.starbucks.com&index=1&md5=87a6dc6d285a2248c14c50032d708dc5) or[www.starbucks.com](https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.starbucks.com&esheet=54616558&newsitemid=20261007776907&lan=en-US&anchor=www.starbucks.com&index=2&md5=c334e529659c48387ad00ae483dc6acf) .


